  *          +-------------------------+---------------+-------------+
  *          |  STM32F30x SPI Pins     |     SD        |    Pin      |
  *          +-------------------------+---------------+-------------+
  *          | SD_SPI_CS_PIN           |   ChipSelect  |    1        |
  *          | SD_SPI_MOSI_PIN / MOSI  |   DataIn      |    2        |
  *          |                         |   GND         |    3 (0 V)  |
  *          |                         |   VDD         |    4 (3.3 V)|
  *          | SD_SPI_SCK_PIN / SCLK   |   Clock       |    5        |
  *          |                         |   GND         |    6 (0 V)  |
  *          | SD_SPI_MISO_PIN / MISO  |   DataOut     |    7        |
